{"id":405,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"主体的に学ぶ喜びから世界へ貢献する武蔵野大中","feature_description":"武蔵野大学中学校は、中高6年間の学びを通じて社会課題を解決し、世界に貢献できる力を身につけることを目指しています。公式サイトでは、生徒が夢中になれる感覚を大切にし、一人ひとりが積極的に自ら学ぶ授業を教育の方針として示します。好きなことや関心を学びの入口にし、主体的な学びを広げる考えが特徴です。各自が夢中になれることを出発点として、授業や活動に自ら取り組む姿勢を大切にしています。","clubs":[{"id":7687,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.musashino-u.ed.jp/j-highschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":7688,"name":"バレーボール部（男子は高校のみ）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.musashino-u.ed.jp/j-highschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":7689,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.musashino-u.ed.jp/j-highschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":7690,"name":"ハンドボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.musashino-u.ed.jp/j-highschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":7691,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.musashino-u.ed.jp/j-highschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":7692,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.musashino-u.ed.jp/j-highschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":7693,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.musashino-u.ed.jp/j-highschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":7694,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.musashino-u.ed.jp/j-highschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":7695,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.musashino-u.ed.jp/j-highschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":7696,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.musashino-u.ed.jp/j-highschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":7697,"name":"競技ドッジボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.musashino-u.ed.jp/j-highschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":7698,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.musashino-u.ed.jp/j-highschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":7699,"name":"茶道部","